      "writtenOn": "2023-12-28T01:00:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eMaking this board specific seems unnecessary. It\u0027s better to add board specific hooks later, only if needed.\n\nOK, we can easily add those later if needed. In that case I will move this code to chipset power handler.\n\nI will still need `board_ap_power_s0_run` to determine when to disable `PWR_DSW_PWROK` \u0026 `PWR_PG_PP1P05`, I will figure something out for this.",
      "parentUuid": "472b8e6a_2f8f95aa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 231,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 265,
        "endChar": 0
